### CampusQuest Practice Arena Tests

### 1. Start Practice Session
POST http://localhost:5000/practice/start
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject_id": 1,
    "unit": 3,
    "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
    "count": 3
}

### 2. Submit Practice Answers
POST http://localhost:5000/practice/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "time_taken_seconds": 45,
    "answers": [
        {
            "question_id": 1,
            "selected_option": "B"
        }
    ]
}

### 3. Get Practice Result
GET http://localhost:5000/practice/1/result
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Get Practice History
GET http://localhost:5000/practice/history
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
